35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, I found the badge records show our arrivals are scattered, so any first-come seating would be decided before half of us are even here.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the quote is six thousand yen per desk, and it repeats for every future change.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, that quote is worrying. But the billing shows we pay for floor area, not people, so those empty desks still cost us forty-one thousand yen monthly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, the pilot floor took four to nine minutes just to settle in each morning. That’s a lot of lost time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the physio’s note says a good setting takes days of small corrections to settle, so that morning time is actually necessary.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I found the drawn plan gives only four desks a window, yet daylight was the top complaint in the survey.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the shuffles dragged on for two weeks each time, with half-packed boxes everywhere.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, two weeks of chaos for every change is unacceptable. We need a layout that stays put, or we’ll be paying that quote forever.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, two weeks of chaos confirms my fear. We need a layout that minimizes that transition pain, not just the cost.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, I suspect those two weeks were mostly spent fighting the noise and the bad chair settings, not just moving boxes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shizue, I found the badge records show our arrivals are scattered, so any first-come seating would be decided before half of us are even here.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the quote confirms moving is expensive, but the shuffles show staying put is painful. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. We must stop paying for empty space and avoid the cost of constant changes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, so the settling time is unavoidable? That means any layout change steals days from our already fragmented mornings.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, Yes, the body needs time to adjust. But if we pick the right spot, those days are a one-time cost, not a recurring tax.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I agree. We must choose a layout that respects our scattered arrivals and avoids the pain of constant shuffling.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, I agree. We must stop paying for empty space and avoid the cost of constant changes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need a stable arrangement that stops the bleeding, but I’m still anxious about the initial cost.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
